            "accordion_heading": "Description",
            "heading_style": "font-heading",
            "accordion_text": "<p><strong>Microbiome-First Longevity Support:</strong><br/><br/>Calmerceuticals® Longevity is a clinically engineered, bio-fermented triple-biotic system designed to support healthy biological ageing at its source.<br/>Rather than chasing surface-level outcomes, Longevity targets one of the core drivers of accelerated ageing: chronic low-grade inflammation linked to microbiome imbalance.<br/>At the centre of the formula is <strong>evaBiome™ EternaGen Polyphenol Complex</strong>, a next-generation bio-fermented polyphenol system combined with a clinically researched Blue Zone probiotic complex delivering 60 billion live probiotics and 10 billion postbiotics per serve.<br/>Together, this precision-engineered system supports the gut–brain–immune axis — helping regulate inflammatory response, protect cognitive function, and strengthen cellular resilience.<br/>This is foundational longevity support.<br/> Built for absorption. Designed for impact.<br/><br/></p>",
            "accordion_liquid": "",
            "accordion_page": "",
            "padding_bottom": 0
          }
        },
