    "faq_section_j69Y9r": {
      "type": "faq-section",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_item_TjaCz9": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How can a formula change my \"biological age\" in just 14 days?",
            "answer": "<p>We don't just \"support\" wellness; we modulate clinical biomarkers. Calmerceuticals Longevity™ is clinically shown to reduce major inflammatory markers—specifically IL-6, CRP, and TNF-α—by up to 90% within a 14-day window. By lowering these signatures, your system shifts from a state of \"defense\" to a state of \"repair,\" effectively resetting your biological clock.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_CQtL6Y": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Why are your probiotics \"Centenarian-Sourced\"?",
            "answer": "<p>Our strains are isolated from the gut microbiomes of verified centenarians in longevity hotspots. These organisms have co-evolved with human longevity biology in ways that commercially farmed strains simply cannot replicate.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_bJxebn": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Will I have to take this forever to keep the results?",
            "answer": "<p>Biological resilience compounds over time. Most users see sustained improvement after 90 days of consistent use, with measurable changes to microbiome diversity that persist well beyond supplementation.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_cqwVpR": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What makes your \"ViaCap\" technology different from a standard capsule?",
            "answer": "<p>Standard capsules dissolve in stomach acid, destroying up to 99% of probiotics before they reach the colon. ViaCap™ micro-encapsulation ensures 95% survivability to the target site.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_DF9wn9": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is it safe to use with other supplements or medications?",
            "answer": "<p>Longevity™ is formulated with clinically researched ingredients at safe, effective doses. We always recommend consulting your healthcare provider if you are on prescription medications.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "faq_item_TjaCz9",
